# Environment template — the offline desktop application needs NO environment
# variables and no secrets to run. There is no database URL, no OAuth client,
# no mail provider and no AI API key: all data lives in a local SQLite file
# under the OS user-data directory, and the solver runs as a local process.
#
# This file exists to document that fact and to reserve the place for optional
# future settings. Do not add cloud credentials here — optional integrations
# belong behind explicit user configuration in Settings, not in the build.

# Optional (development only): point the solver launcher at a specific Python
# interpreter via the PYTHON_BIN environment variable. Packaged builds use the
# bundled solver binary and ignore it.
#   PYTHON_BIN=C:\path\to\python.exe
